flowchart TB
 A[Retrieved input field sqrt W] --> L[Linear spectral propagator]
 D[Dispersion and mirror phase] --> L
 L --> K[Kerr time phase step]
 G[Pass geometry and n2] --> K
 K --> P[Per pass loss and loop]
 P --> L
 P --> C[Compressor spectral phase]
 C --> E[Fixed main window energy]
 C --> R[Phase sensitive retrieval comparison]
 E --> O[Robust multiobjective trade]
 R --> O
 F[Supplied optic constraints] --> O
